{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1405,
  "batch_count": 1645,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "d2656fb43e00556ee3186c852692cfa26a722dbc",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dae804b427392d8a846dbc55",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "请您好好注视着我哦！\n在训练员身边的话，\n我一定能绽放地比所有人都绚丽！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e642d0c3392bee4d1669a566d7bd3b201bfa85984d77b5ba2b9031b58d04246",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108c4aae874d9d3f9b5c41cf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天游客很多，所以稍微有些紧张…\n――不对！不该这样！必须每日精进\n才行！打起精神来，千代王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b22df2f3453472ef42f19c55accde8d97780b4aded182d24f408e001f2c76b37",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5db926a5a780adfb80f94b48",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "出发吧！\r\n如翩翩起舞般～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "97d93d61bc81cb6ed8b1b25bea86d41eb870ef6a58ee1ead46e22b5549cd4cfd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:802acb480c9df5a6f4c08c01",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「就算期盼花期也可能会落空」。\r\n既然如此，\r\n就只能靠自己的实力了，对吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9ae45fbfd6765e9f7b8450404aecf256db87b0eb3e37c248c5c696149ff7c81",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec855258139fcf50336a859b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "偶尔也要华丽地划下句号！\r\n唔，我能做到吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "baebbf44853526bdce4acd79a21a74bc9c8588054fd6fefc28bdb80196c357b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8e374b790877200660716d36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我相信日复一日的努力，\r\n终将迎来美好的转折点！",
      "source_fingerprint": "224f3994935aa314f3e80a0aad9641b6fceee676f01334074b014df9ce0b7320",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:889a3992f9e7eeda6cf5ba0c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我希望能让训练员的笑容\r\n如花朵般绽放♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "eb70e61b2eb9841ff6d97c04d3b7487e4aa8fa34f621212f8b648fb60b661359",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c6315f5a2d3e4e1dc0a68d00",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「即使是终将凋零的花，\r\n在凋零之前也依然美丽」。\r\n我们两人的花，绝对不会褪色的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "516d809ae9ac6c4fe6b58ce4c4b5da48adfdc6cdae789d57b1551bfaeb3a1424",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c795c8b4c42b8355a3b05a8a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任何重要的典礼，\r\n都希望有训练员陪在我身边……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "428044519d7297fa27e7dfe8a24eb2066fc277fb755c4879c8d6ea3707c36e7f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "92022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28eac3ed66ab2c20f0042f65",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从今往后……\n我也会继续在您身边盛情绽放哦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4aff05293b0a2dd4f552093453f2efac0aea4e8ba7effaded748736072a4bf25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c43e308a077ebb9c279f00b8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我……终于盛开了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2151575f204eded46b80ebdeb5c014ce4b92e83a7f6d95fcbea528b1f20ed0ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:744b0082c20288362002598a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "希望你能永远记住\r\n我今天的身影。",
      "source_fingerprint": "157d3e011c4fab3811a0f7b3c2e92656f1f449e0862d45870d64d02d132f8999",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "93004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2cf5d7d0e4338893047764c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是否成为全新的樱花了呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1339b982472bb77efbbe18b8de73145c1a50547a9b597f2a4c4dda66d90185ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "93005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f2d89fa96377716cafaa1c7d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还需要不断精进呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a1ff39691e7c93366f8a7fe5b2ed3da9648519d42a79da96d8777a521760e5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3316c80693208da8c66666f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会绽放得更加绚丽的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c029f4a457b52b03e7a50f2b8e8b3071f0febbe9aff64d785e8689d53b17bf79",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f9de5af2b2eb73e934fa2323",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "樱花千代王，会加油的！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ddf1a91094edfdebbea32b60b70b4f1580c90726ccf9e2a40569a41b88cb039",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2291bc3e46d008d6ec059d6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "『樱花会因努力而满开』！\n为了实现梦想，我出赛了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e2d99db4ef8e3ce731c31cb85e4ce28a0c4e1818c506815e0c3e76d1e02202e4",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:04d151e8cc78a1fb7db415ed",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我有变得比以前更厉害吗！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b0f1d677dad838d0f7036e95c22847068d0b0f749641a1490f6dc3d2cabab7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1b1e4cd2f1ab7a4f0c56c2bb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "噢噢！又一朵花绽放了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe5ecf7ded5fff3ab721b4bb54c8f34764c2d667b7049904303746bfdc3100ac",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a06127d0cd08524b214fb824",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "又绽放一朵樱花了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1768b51b885acb9a73e6fdf1c91731308a827683941501ef58b50c9888071b93",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2d6e586727d80a06ac3e634f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "朝着蓝天努力长大～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "b877d00c21426df068bbf63d05a67b643b0260280bc004cf7b2acb79421d4d64",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:47496deffd58c522b5a0529c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "成为与邂逅季节相称的\r\n最棒的樱花！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd1e4912ce67ccc151cf3b9aede099c7d29e75fcb3b082aa90b488fb957de99e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:60fd6122f14d0f61f697be09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我是稍微盛装打扮的\r\n樱花千代王！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8409eba04ad47a22dc0bdd6855d843705c1fc6205729df5d028ebae072cfb22c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1069",
        "95010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0e5dc5dcffff6733d42c5517",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "绷紧神经！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fafe14c523948a653a1bc374df5d06fcaf3c54ed793f1b61b4c898bb6fc12292",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a5eed6aa3d5ed9164e3c2718",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我的道路全由自己决定。将牢笼和\r\n锁链全数破坏，在目标的「世界」\r\n里大放异彩的──将会是我。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6a5833874881fc45bee1107bda0c1ac8749bd5fb51d85d96963f41b0d69d635c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a41acb72750d0381f596975",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行ってくる。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5c258c6fbb37905535703e68e2fc288861a7a636980f7eab0cb36dd332608f75",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00ffdd690510d1bac4516f25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "戻ったぞ。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cb603bcbaf54388661ce8ddfcaa8d5fc2aa49d8bacf52392c7a69c44dc9517b3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08a1b37e6b0ba0a70f76979f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小狗的牙齿越尖锐，我越喜欢。\r\n因为这样才有调教的价值。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9be9a5ccead928661dd087d081d3e4a7afc34c0f7479636fc966863bb115e18",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f20a56894639992161824ef2",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，那边那只眼神焦虑的小狗，\r\n你能够立即说出\r\n最闪耀一等星的名字吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "1cd14568cf2133cc4cda55b1ab3e000dd4fa3b0ae58e44ed0fed9b8592f568fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7ac5fc96e802b663e031ad4d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年吗……真是麻烦的时节，那些\r\n料理让人感到沉重。更何况那家伙的\r\n脸在学园里已经看够了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5543ca557051f7388dbc44be38e8c978acace9c1996b05aa71f324d6ab19bcd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:90e90518435afd0fc16f901f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喂，暂时借你的训练员室一用。\r\n我想找个地方存放\r\n这些甜到腻的供品。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de0d595b85f17254fe8213866a59cab9faf208c37a5b1299a537c34e04e63941",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:266f02aa388b97c381710cfc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你可别忘了要向主人摇尾巴啊。\r\n该献给我的话呢？\r\n──你应该明白吧，小狗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91296ba6e1d17c856ff7cb178215b8ea219d281ff4ed083885e2d56d7528b0e1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:da08aac734777d48890fae0d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一年一度梦寐以求的相遇啊……\r\n若能好好遵守我的指示，扮演好\r\n洋娃娃的角色我就不担心了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "de8468276b62501ea700c8ff9465337489d98b5e6a761d8346dd32c3d10f2123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cb1a7f0d89e6392c522b8898",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "万圣节的回忆吗？\r\n我只记得连我的朋友都和我一起穿上\r\n狼人装了吧？但都是小时候的事了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a04b5cc0bce0d47748dba21a201f938553b91e8dd27e026e2941afb771458541",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b65d8294528fe6b09d6b8ce1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啧……我要出去。\r\n学生会主办的什么派对，\r\n让整间食堂吵得要命。",
      "source_fingerprint": "fa9de074b9ede13b339c86012daa3e3b77021758512594d3cd9289c41536bfc3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e9ffebd84e0137d15521013b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "才想说怎么冷成这样，\r\n原来是预报说会下雪啊。\r\n──快准备好，小狗。带你去散步。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3069ab513a7b366e4010e0b6f112d51f904bc5fd90b557f9c396b888f4daebc1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf004d92ab077dc98068c23d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你们做得很好呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0415045b1428fd4edc52342a94cdc8c6aa8cc372a0bc8dbdd3b0459eefa392de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:24a11ec3a4cc7e5d5a7426c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不论新的一年是否到来，\r\n要做的事也不会有所改变。\r\n我只要开拓我自己的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9fa660723bce20619fa3aa939cec8f5a4310fb28dcea80520d04eb1cb5dfc7bc",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8444b7d5df498c3377465112",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喔，生日啊。转三圈再叫一声\r\n来听听，这样我至少可以帮你\r\n唱首生日快乐歌。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86a55a24571c83882ba476d02926ebb717908fdd3b7ca205a189a4032e8ee39f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eca7f8fa64e14b64f4d13805",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "……身为小狗的你到处奔波忙碌，\r\n算是表现得挺出色的嘛。\r\n奖励拿去吧，可别忘了摇尾巴啰？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e0c0fdb50f8708af49f4c69606c6f30666f5b0fc5a1061a037746e9027a90273",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2df5ba9a2af1fcfcc3db4d8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "从以前开始，我的生日礼物\r\n都是高级训练用具……至少我还有\r\n自己是在呵护中长大的自觉。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df539986d77bcb2dd4b4e27a4ad06d3bc8f8e7d4f2df347b4b4654ab0960f3ec",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:53ed8661a609809ce0e6a335",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你问我想要什么生日礼物啊……好像\r\n差不多得换个新的小狗项圈了呢？\r\n──哈哈！别当真了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6b6f2fe41684f18277711b6f0c91afcb1e9cde3b9806bd0b100496470bd5a59",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f5820acf3be10cc6909814b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "收到公告了。\r\n快点去确认吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b8bd15ee0df46658dc2810576a8dea586fb2dfb8c2dd942198879f72ee4dbc3e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:41637254281b244dbd8f7008",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "竟然会有送给小狗的礼物啊。\r\n看来你有乖乖在当好孩子呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a57a1db2dfd81820fc50b3dca17e838236653e1d0849645ad887c120bed1fae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fb3fc029f3046f0327d03a42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "任务好像达成了啊。\r\n下次也务必妥善完成。",
      "source_fingerprint": "bb66e3551edbbffa4983bd3d21cadf75a8f7dd4a4a88c4236e478cf99fdf6768",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4dc4c07d146d70436aa12b3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "似乎在举办活动。\r\n……只要那家伙不要多管闲事，\r\n我怎样都无所谓。",
      "source_fingerprint": "db582285ec35f59eab0d892120f23bc03ba19ac8ea703c1a31bd22408b67d7a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:28d0b8057b47d777b14ad2fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "活动正在举办。\r\n参不参加随便你。\r\n我可没兴趣整天牵着你。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e581e0ed2cbfc1e55d4a84e20490ef9cd0067647bbf23b5b0b31969b214e99db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:31357208958773ddee94cff7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别屈服，还有下次机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b52980946268af9115ff13b206de7d41b4de74d2682d68edfb24bb09472c7f38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:083ee91eb9254df7edbc7a77",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "名册的等级似乎提升了。\r\n记得去确认一遍。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8c6a000a5ffa108c17a8318471139e768e24bc778195aad5e3f3dd11bad65167",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:eea59e8b7afe8a813f4dcb07",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "仕立て先は決めたところがある。\r\n腕がいい。文句つけんなら、税関で\r\n郵送に時間がかかることくらいだな",
      "source_fingerprint": "8dd98e435a63522773046489332936a31085989f95eabe595b9de5cbee6d0284",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5dab057fb907ad5ad28f093b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生地もアクセサリーも、\r\n他人が選択したモンはどうも\r\n着心地が悪い。",
      "source_fingerprint": "830634a065970fd4d205e07923f53052a22ff0ba4e055b484368f7e85f6c9a2d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c58da347e51c54264f30d3d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "この靴は、脚ぶん回すのにも\r\nちょうどよくてな…。\r\nハハッ、試してやろうか？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0b94db0ca6c1e49839af0eddd3ea6fe58e11990d2e450a5c0f48a92d78e72c5c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "10027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7b851c6a4f889defa0747eff",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哼，还差一步啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "706d8b6a30ec5ea20d47a6c1aedcb77b3b2a3a2ec20536c4994390c5817d6123",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1496e2fdb4ef97cfd860e8fa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是理所当然的结果。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8268e3074e5a16b79ba4787a8cde185924899d24b88fe9970b7dd1b20cd4d9e7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1070",
        "1004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:651acefcea50142a41852038",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "别屈服，还有下次机会。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b52980946268af9115ff13b206de7d41b4de74d2682d68edfb24bb09472c7f38",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
